1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,293
Let’s Help Adolescents.
让我们帮助青少年。

2
00:00:04,293 --> 00:01:14,253
Whether they are male or female, adolescents feel like deciding on everything themselves in spite of parents’ instruction, especially when they face problems like sex, mental stress, etc., which make them feel ashamed and embarrassed. Thus they often automatically get into trouble due to their imperfect comprehension and judgement. Some are addicted to cigarettes, only several packets of which will hurt their lungs and make them breathless quickly.
无论男生还是女生，青少年都想自己决定一切，不顾父母的教导，尤其当他们面对性方面的问题，精神压力等等，这些问题会让他们羞愧、尴尬。所以，他们往往不自觉地陷入麻烦，因为理解力和判断力还不成熟。有些人沉迷于吸烟，几包烟就会伤害他们的肺，使他们很快变得气喘吁吁。

3
00:01:14,253 --> 00:02:09,847
Others can’t quit drinking alcohol, whose harmful effects include causing young pregnant women to abort or give birth to abnormal babies. The worst is drug abuse, for the withdrawal is tough once their bodies are accustomed to the drugs. Meanwhile, those who share needles bought from illegal chemists are at great risk of being infected with desperate AIDS.
另一些人戒不掉酒，酒精的危害包括导致年轻孕妇流产，或生下有健康异常的婴儿。最糟糕的是滥用毒品，因为身体一旦习惯了毒品，戒断就很难。与此同时，那些共用从非法药商处买来的针头的人，面临很高的感染风险；原文将此表述为患上艾滋病。

4
00:02:09,847 --> 00:02:46,740
If so, neither injecting nor taking pills can guarantee their survival. However, don’t be disappointed at or have prejudice against our children so easily. After all, being awkward is an appendix of youth.
如果这样，无论注射还是服药，都无法保证他们活下来。不过，不要轻易对我们的孩子失望，或对他们抱有偏见。毕竟，笨拙不成熟也伴随着青春期。

5
00:02:46,740 --> 00:03:06,800
As long as we strengthen communication with them instead of only banning this or banning that, we will surely help them avoid anything unfit.
只要我们加强与他们的沟通，而不只是一味禁止这个、禁止那个，就一定能帮助他们远离不适合他们的事物。
